WEBVTT

00:00:29.084 --> 00:00:31.252
Liquor stores,

00:00:31.252 --> 00:00:33.564
fast food,

00:00:33.564 --> 00:00:36.205
vacant lots.

00:00:36.205 --> 00:00:39.676
Just like 26.5 million other Americans,

00:00:39.676 --> 00:00:42.236
I live in a food desert,

00:00:42.236 --> 00:00:44.300
South Central Los Angeles,

00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:48.501
home of the drive-thru and the drive-by.

00:00:48.501 --> 00:00:53.940
Funny thing is, the drive-thrus are killing more people than the drive-bys.

00:00:53.940 --> 00:00:56.441
People are dying from curable diseases

00:00:56.441 --> 00:00:59.276
in South Central Los Angeles.

00:00:59.276 --> 00:01:01.877
For instance, the obesity rate in my neighborhood